{"matched":34,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0150b01","n":"0150b","t":"今凡著名僧傳及傳所不載者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0150c01","n":"0150c","t":"照之功著故般若無知無名之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0151a01","n":"0151a","t":"不形證漚和功也適化眾生謂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0151b01","n":"0151b","t":"何所往何則求向物於向於向"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0151c01","n":"0151c","t":"莫二之真心吐不一之殊教乖"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0152a01","n":"0152a","t":"不真空論第二夫至虛無生者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0152b01","n":"0152b","t":"無者第一真諦也尋夫不有不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0152c01","n":"0152c","t":"故不有緣起故不無尋理即其"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0153a01","n":"0153a","t":"而不在是以聖人乘千化而不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0153b01","n":"0153b","t":"而實其照終日知而未嘗知也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0153c01","n":"0153c","t":"不自有其知而聖人未嘗不有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0154a01","n":"0154a","t":"通其鑒不知非不知欲以辨其"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0154b01","n":"0154b","t":"取矣答曰非無知故不取又非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0154c01","n":"0154c","t":"知故有知可無可謂知無非曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0155a01","n":"0155a","t":"佇悅之勤良以深矣緬然無因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0155b01","n":"0155b","t":"靈怕獨感耶若窮靈極數妙盡"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0155c01","n":"0155c","t":"之雅詠高致悠然清散未期厚"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0156a01","n":"0156a","t":"往南君閑詳試可取看來問婉"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0156b01","n":"0156b","t":"因謂之有因謂之有者應夫真"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0156c01","n":"0156c","t":"會之耳又云宜先定聖心所以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0157a01","n":"0157a","t":"惡是生生生奔競孰與止之是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0157b01","n":"0157b","t":"止於心即無復於生死既無生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0157c01","n":"0157c","t":"為亦名滅度無為者取乎虛無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0158a01","n":"0158a","t":"會斯乃希夷之境太玄之鄉而"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0158b01","n":"0158b","t":"則懷德者彌仰於聖功斯乃誥"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0158c01","n":"0158c","t":"無名無名之道於何不名是以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0159a01","n":"0159a","t":"流而不燋心非我生故日用而"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0159b01","n":"0159b","t":"無有有無相生其猶高下相傾"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0159c01","n":"0159c","t":"於會通所以不出不在而道存"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0160a01","n":"0160a","t":"為而有差別此以人三三於無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0160b01","n":"0160b","t":"無患雖同而升虛有遠近無為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0160c01","n":"0160c","t":"益交陳既以取捨為心損益為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0161a01","n":"0161a","t":"窮源第十六有名曰非眾生無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1858_p0161b01","n":"0161b","t":"無名曰夫真由離起偽因著生"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T45n1858-肇論","source":"CBETA T45n1858 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":34,"unit":"T45 頁欄"}